1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,075
Traced clockwise, the net work done by the gas is positive.

2
00:00:04,075 --> 00:00:05,221
That is an engine.

3
00:00:05,221 --> 00:00:09,921
Traced anticlockwise, it is negative, and that is a refrigerator.

4
00:00:09,921 --> 00:00:12,057
We will meet both in the next unit.

